# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Load-bearing exclusions carried from Mira Core. This repository is public and
# hydrates evidence bodies from the shared Archive catalog, which Mira Core
# deliberately keeps out of Git. These two lines must land before any hydration
# runs against this checkout, or the seed republishes what its parent withholds.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Hydrated Mira Archive body mirrors (canonical bytes live outside Git)
/archive/sources/geopolitics/sources/

# Private continuity payloads are hydrated locally and never published by default.
/mira/continuity/captures/

# Hydrated Library text bodies, if a local working view is ever materialized.
# Canonical texts live in the shared external store, not in this repository.
/archive/library/texts/

# Retired in-checkout private payload path; ignored only to prevent accidental
# admission of legacy material. Live state belongs outside Git.
/.mira-private/

# Explicit local provenance stores; schemas and code remain versioned.
/mira/provenance/*.sqlite3
/mira/provenance/*.sqlite3-*
